OL,3,GNEWSAHow Microsoft outage is affecting
OL,4,ASouth East NHS trusts, councils and
OL,5,Apolice
OL,6,
OL,7,FNHS trusts, councils and police in the
OL,8,Fsouth-east of England have been
OL,9,Faffected by the global Microsoft
OL,10,Foutage.
OL,12,FMicrosoft 365 Services, including
OL,13,FTeams, Outlook and Microsoft's
OL,14,Fartificial intelligence software
OL,15,FCopilot, were hit by "connectivity
OL,16,Fproblems", the company says.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
