OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHow Microsoft outage is affecting
OL,4,ASouth East NHS trusts, councils and
OL,5,Apolice
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Friday morning, most NHS trusts
OL,8,Facross Surrey, East and West Sussex,
OL,9,Fand Kent reported issues receiving and
OL,10,Fsending emails, while some said patient
OL,11,Finquiries and referral correspondences
OL,12,Fwere also affected.
OL,14,FPatients have been urged to contact NHS
OL,15,Ftrusts by phone and to continue to
OL,16,Fattend planned appointments.
